<title>USA: Donnelly Corp Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Donnelly Corp Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOLLAND, Mich. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>			 Three Months Ended	Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			  March 29  March 30    March 29    March 30</p>
<p>				1997	1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales	    $181,681   $116,445   $483,118   $313,791</p>
<p> Cost of sales	 148,689     94,292    392,207    257,923</p>
<p> Operating Income	5,403	3,920     18,945	5,732</p>
<p>Minority interest in net (income)</p>
<p>   loss of subsidiaries  490	 (16)	(104)	  186</p>
<p>Equity in earnings (losses)</p>
<p>   of affiliates	   314	(238)	(331)	(482)</p>
<p> Net income		2,958	2,503	8,597	3,343</p>
<p> Net income per share   0.30	 0.26	 0.87	 0.34</p>
<p> Average shares	  9,849	9,766	9,822	9,743</p>
<p>NOTE: All shares outstanding and per share results adjusted to reflect five-for-four stock split distributed on January 30, 1997.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
